Package: mouse-control
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mouse Control local build <local@localhost.invalid>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-cairo, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, udev
Description: Native Logitech mouse controls
 Inspect 71 Logitech mouse models in an interactive GTK application.
 Depending on the mouse and connection, display live sensitivity, monitor
 button presses, change DPI and polling rate, or edit onboard assignments.
